:"149.99","price_max":"149.99","price_min":"149.99","tags":["C2052 Conveyor Chain","chain_size: C2052","Conveyor Roller Chain","dept:Roller Chain","Double Pitch Conveyor Roller Chain","Double Pitch Roller Chain","filter_Chain Size: C2052","filter_Chain Width (F): 0.806\"","filter_Connecting Link Width (G): 0.856\"","filter_material_type: Carbon Steel","filter_Pin Diameter (D): 0.200\"","filter_Pitch (P): 1.250\"","filter_Plate Height (H): 0.593\"","filter_Plate Thickness (T): 0.080\"","filter_quality_level: Premium \/ Premier Series","filter_Roller Diameter (R): 0.750\"","filter_Roller Width (W): 0.375\"","filter_Tensile Strength: 6446 LBS","filter_Weight: 0.885 LBS\/ FT","filter_Working Load: 990 LBS","More Roller Chains","New_filter_number of strands: 1","New_filter_pin diameter: 0.200\"","New_filter_pitch: 1.250\"","Roller Chain","sub:Conveyor Roller Chain"],"title":"Premium C2052 Roller Chain - 10ft Box","type":"Roller Chain","url":"\/products\/pre-c2052-roller-chain?_pos=2\u0026_psq=C2052+roller+chain\u0026_psid=d90509f5d\u0026_ss=e","variants":[],"vendor":"USA ROLLER CHAIN","featured_image":{"alt":"Premium C2052 Roller Chain - 10ft Box","aspect_ratio":2.08,"height":577,"url":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0633\/0187\/7925\/files\/PRE-C2042-ROLLER-CHAIN-2_2cd5909a-0949-4fdb-98b6-61f523e947b5.jpg?v=1756380669","width":1200}},{"available":true,"body":"\u003cb style=\"background-color: initial;\"\u003e\u003cinline style=\"color: rgb(192, 80, 77); font-size: 16px;\"\u003eThis Premium C2052 Double Pitch O-ring roller chain with oversized rollers is a great upgrade for your application. O-ring chain has been tested and results have shown that O-ring chain can last up to 10 times longer than standard roller chain. The O-ring chain is named for the rubber O-rings built into the space between the outside link plate and the inside roller link plates. O-rings are included as a way to improve lubrication to the links of power transmission chains, a service that is vitally important to extending their working life. These rubber fixtures form a barrier that holds factory applied lubricating grease inside of the pin and bushing wear areas. Further, the rubber O-rings prevent dirt and other contaminants from entering the inside of the chain linkages, where such particles would otherwise cause significant wear. This O-Ring roller chain has heat treated \u0026amp; shot peened components that greatly extend the working life and strength of the chain. This chain is also constructed using high quality carbon steel and high quality O-Rings. O-ring chain fits in standard chain applications and will run on ANSI standard sprockets. From industrial to agriculture, our O-ring Series roller chain is designed to last longer than any standard roller chain. This chain will be supplied as a 10ft box including one connecting link.\u003c\/inline\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e","compare_at_price_max":"0.00","compare_at_price_min":"0.00","handle":"premium-c2052or-chain","id":14649200116079,"image":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0633\/0187\/7925\/files\/PREMIUM-C2052OR-CHAIN-2.jpg?v=1756381551","price":"0.00","price_max":"0.00","price_min":"0.00","tags":["C2052 O-Ring Roller Chain","chain_size: C2052","dept:Roller Chain","filter_Chain Size: C2052 O-Ring Roller Chain","filter_Link Plate Height (H): 0.594","filter_Link Plate Thickness (T): 0.079","filter_material_type: Carbon Steel","filter_Note: All Dimensions Are Given In Inches","filter_Pin Diameter (D): 0.200","filter_Pitch (P): 1.250","filter_quality_level: Premium \/ Premier Series","filter_Roller Diameter (R): 0.750","filter_Roller Width (W): 0.375","filter_Tensile Strength: 6160lbs","filter_Working Load: 990lbs","Long-Lasting O-Ring Roller Chain","More Roller Chains","New_filter_number of strands: 1","New_filter_pin diameter: 0.200\"","New_filter_pitch: 1.250\"","Roller Chain","sub:Long-Lasting O-Ring Roller Chain"],"title":"Premium C2052 O-Ring Roller Chain - 10ft Box","type":"Roller Chain","url":"\/products\/premium-c2052or-chain?_pos=3\u0026_psq=C2052+roller+chain\u0026_psid=d90509f5d\u0026_ss=e","variants":[],"vendor":"USA ROLLER CHAIN","featured_image":{"alt":"Premium C2052 O-Ring Roller Chain","aspect_ratio":2.08,"height":577,"url":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0633\/0187\/7925\/files\/PREMIUM-C2052OR-CHAIN-2.jpg?v=1756381551","width":1200}},{"available":true,"body":"\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003eThis C2052 chain is manufactured in accordance to ANSI B29.1 standards dimensionally. Basically meaning that it will directly interchange with a multitude of brands and manufactures. What sets this economically priced chain apart from others is the use of heat-treated and shot peened components which drastically increase the strength and overall durability of the chain. It is also factory pre-stretched which means lower elongation over the life of the chain, additionally, all of our ANSI roller chains are shipped with a high-quality lubricant. Other common industry terms for C2052 roller chain are; C2052 conveyor chain or C2052 oversized roller chain. This is due to the large rollers that extend past the side plates on the chain. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eC2052 Chain Operation\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0633\/0187\/7925\/files\/Double_Pitch_Roller_Chain_5fe4ffc4-3f6d-4079-8b22-d02ef747c0db.gif?v=1737624689\" style=\"width: 224px;\" alt=\"C2052 Roller Chain 10ft Box\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAs you can see above the implementation of oversized rollers makes it to where the chain can smoothly and productively roll or convey on top of a surface. The main benefit of this feature is that it can turn complex conveying jobs and applications int simplified ones. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eC2052 Roller Chain Dimensions\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0633\/0187\/7925\/files\/conv111_844ef808-a235-44e9-be2d-fea274ff83cb.png?v=1737624567\" style=\"width: 569px;\" alt=\"C2052 Roller Chain 10ft Box\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 16px;\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(192, 80, 77); font-size: 16px;\"\u003eChain Size: C2052\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(192, 80, 77); font-size: 16px;\"\u003ePitch (P): 1.250\"\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(192, 80, 77); font-size: 16px;\"\u003eRoller Width (W): 0.375\"\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(192, 80, 77); font-size: 16px;\"\u003eRoller Diameter (R): 0.750\"\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(192, 80, 77); font-size: 16px;\"\u003ePlate Height (H): 0.593\"\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(192, 80, 77); font-size: 16px;\"\u003ePlate Thickness (T): 0.080\"\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(192, 80, 77); font-size: 16px;\"\u003ePin Diameter (D): 0.200\"\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(192, 80, 77); font-size: 16px;\"\u003eChain Width (F): 0.806\"\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\t\u003cli\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(192, 80, 77); font-size: 16px;\"\