:"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0633\/0187\/7925\/files\/ECO-C2042-ROLLER-CHAIN-2_ec8adb6b-1059-4e80-b63b-e90cc2d485d2.jpg?v=1756372463","width":342}},{"available":true,"body":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003e\u003cinline style=\"color: rgb(192, 145, 0); font-size: 24px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eC2052 Self Lubricating Roller Chain\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/inline\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cinline style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125); font-size: 16px;\"\u003eC2052 self lubricating roller chain is a maintenance free roller chain that is found in applications where proper chain lubrication is difficult or impossible to achieve. This C2052 self lubricating roller chain features sintered alloy bushings, which are oil impregnated and work with the specially treated bearing pins releasing lubricant when and where necessary to achieve maximum working life with no additional lubrication needed. It also has heat-treated ANSI components that are manufactured out of high quality carbon steel to provide a high strength and durable roller chain. Self lubricating roller chain saves you time and money by not having to be manually lubricated, having a long economic life with no additional lubrication purchases needed, less down time which leads to more production, and providing a clean run which reduces the risk of contamination products, machines, floors, and more. One thing that is always important to remember when running self lubricating roller chain is to always use sprockets with hardened teeth. For more information on C2052 Self Lubricating Roller Chain or to get a quote please contact us.\u003c\/inline\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cinline style=\"color: rgb(192, 80, 77); font-size: 18px;\"\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/inline\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0633\/0187\/7925\/files\/C2_NP_DWG_feeb89fb-e658-4c21-9d5d-e773f045cdde.png?v=1737624577\" style=\"width: 565px